{"v":4,"catch":"Pool With Me — 終極 8 號球撞球挑戰！","desc":"拿起球桿，準備迎接最刺激的撞球體驗！Pool With Me 讓你以 3D 和 2D 模式暢玩 8 號球——無論你喜歡真實物理模擬，還是快節奏的街機玩法。\n\n• 與朋友對戰 – 本地最多 4 人同樂，或線上挑戰全球玩家。\n• 5 種風格場地 – 從霓虹酒吧到經典撞球廳，每張球桌都有獨特氛圍。\n• 冠軍賽模式 – 證明實力，攀升排名，成為最強玩家！\n• 易學難精 – 簡單操作適合新手，深度玩法滿足高手。\n\n無論是快速對戰、派對娛樂，還是激烈錦標賽，Pool With Me 都能帶來樂趣！\n\n準備好稱霸球桌了嗎？","publisher":"Soroka Games","release":"2025-04-17","genres":["運動","派對","動作","其他"],"players":"單機 1–4 人 · 網路 2 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":4,"poff":4,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 2.8GB / Switch 2.8GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f0b0f53f88fc8ea0d50d10ebf6be5a18492c276a1c9ba4673ade89343c0a14f7.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/887d5865161ce3d9806beac0735b0cec66342fbdaab95148e1631153fef917f8.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0ec5a186e3b944d461f7e17241c5db2408a92466f8b6c836589ed97e19d638fa.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a1e81c52ef1a844b7f40e17431b22d81a2e4540af0141f962726fc6ac982af20.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/6e0f064ae5a150dc8809cd14f504a4cdcfac4661a93790405a421a1b867f3a69.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/47777c52f7472da617f6fbf219d76aa0b45b1098e728a9c86511906ed0f1f92e.jpg"],"titleId":"010063e0230ce000","dlc":[]}